OL,3,ADemocratic Senate leader Schumer set to
OL,4,Aface leadership challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenator Chuck Schumer is facing a
OL,7,Fchallenge to his position as US Senate
OL,8,Fmajority leader from his fellow
OL,9,FDemocratic Senator Chris Van Hollen, as
OL,10,Fthe party prepares to take control of
OL,11,FCongress after sweeping the midterm
OL,12,Felections.
OL,14,FVan Hollen, 67, said in a post on X on
OL,15,FThursday that Americans voted for
OL,16,Fchange earlier this month and "to
OL,17,Fdeliver, we need new leadership".
OL,19,FSchumer, 75, has led Democrats in the
OL,20,Fchamber since 2017, serving as both
OL,21,Fmajority and minority leader. He was
OL,22,Ffirst elected to the Senate in 1999.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
