OL,3,ADemocratic Senate leader Schumer set to
OL,4,Aface leadership challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the midterms earlier this
OL,7,Fmonth, his position has come under
OL,8,Fpressure by some left-wing Democrats
OL,9,Fwho see him as too moderate and part of
OL,10,Fthe party establishment.
